  "note": "Three model-aware T3 capture anchors stage observations. Dormant render/flush hooks execute only atomic guards and create no probe session, goroutine, socket, or probe allocation. Model observation, publication admission, and output commit use non-blocking CAS/try admission; contention fails semantic completeness closed. Unknown, private, scalar, nil, and depth-limited model subtrees remain structurally visible as opaque-container nodes with custom-container-enumeration degradation. Ref-counted Program ownership drains the bounded worker FIFO only after the last concurrent run exits.",
